### Agent reporting — manual requests against the loopback driver
### Start it first:  bun run --cwd packages/agent reporting:driver
### Fixture chain, fixture wallets and a recorded transport: orchestration only, never live proof.

@base = http://127.0.0.1:8787
@origin = http://127.0.0.1:8787

### 1. A gardener writes from a fixture WhatsApp chat
POST {{base}}/__synthetic/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kind": "message",
  "providerRealm": "whatsapp-fixture:wefa",
  "eventId": "manual-1",
  "providerMessageId": "manual-in-1",
  "chat": { "externalChatId": "chat-ada", "kind": "direct" },
  "sender": { "externalSubjectId": "+2340000000001" },
  "sentAt": 1790000000000,
  "text": "Today I planted twelve baobab seedlings by the fence"
}

### 2. Read what the agent sent (buttons carry reply IDs for step 3)
GET {{base}}/__driver/outbox?since=0

### 3. Answer a button: copy its `id` into replyId, and its label into text
POST {{base}}/__synthetic/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kind": "message",
  "providerRealm": "whatsapp-fixture:wefa",
  "eventId": "manual-2",
  "providerMessageId": "manual-in-2",
  "chat": { "externalChatId": "chat-ada", "kind": "direct" },
  "sender": { "externalSubjectId": "+2340000000001" },
  "sentAt": 1790000001000,
  "text": "I agree",
  "replyId": "p:<prompt-id>:agree"
}

### 4. Stage the sample spreadsheet or a generated photo as provider media
PUT {{base}}/__driver/media/sheet-1
Content-Type: text/csv

< ./samples/planting.csv

###
POST {{base}}/__driver/media/photo-1/sample-photo

### 5. Open a link from the outbox: the locator is the last path segment of its URL
POST {{base}}/api/messaging/challenges
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}
X-GG-Bootstrap: 1

{ "requestId": "<locator>" }

### 6. Sign the proof with a fixture wallet (the driver builds the exact message)
POST {{base}}/__driver/wallets/ada/prove
Content-Type: application/json

{ "challengeId": "<challengeId from step 5>" }

### 7. Submit that proof from the same cookie jar with the CSRF token from step 5
POST {{base}}/api/messaging/challenges/<challengeId>/proof
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}
X-GG-CSRF: <csrfToken from step 5>

{ "account": "<account from step 6>", "signature": "<signature from step 6>" }

### 8. Operator view of the queues and switches
GET {{base}}/reporting/ops/health
Authorization: Bearer driver-local-token

### 9. Pause publication (reconciliation keeps running)
POST {{base}}/reporting/ops/controls/publication
Authorization: Bearer driver-local-token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "enabled": false, "reason": "manual pause while testing" }
